WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.662
Computer MCP: work while you're away from the screen.

00:00:03.662 --> 00:00:07.662
You talk to ChatGPT in your headset, and your Mac does the work.

00:00:08.512 --> 00:00:09.452
While you drive:

00:00:09.452 --> 00:00:13.036
write a reply to yesterday's customer and save it as a draft.

00:00:15.553 --> 00:00:19.646
While you go for a walk: what's left on the project for Friday?

00:00:20.845 --> 00:00:25.340
While you do the dishes: ask your Claude Code chat to finish the fix.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:30.042
ChatGPT reaches your Mac over a secure connection.

00:00:30.042 --> 00:00:33.124
The Mac must be on, with the panel open.

00:00:35.356 --> 00:00:39.875
The Mac asks you first. You approve a new connection with Touch ID,

00:00:39.875 --> 00:00:43.112
and the terminal stays off until you turn it on.

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:50.450
One press on STOP deletes all access and stops the connection.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:53.130
Closing the panel stops everything too.

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:57.368
Computer MCP is free and open source, for the Mac.

00:00:57.368 --> 00:00:59.807
Work by voice, away from the screen.
